<!doctype html>
<html lang="pt-BR">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
  <meta name="color-scheme" content="dark">
  <meta name="theme-color" content="#0a111d">
  <meta name="description" content="Portfólio de Bruno Machado Furno Pires, estudante de Engenharia Elétrica no IFES e estagiário de O&M na AXIA Energia (Eletrobras): automação, integração de sistemas, dados e engenharia de controle.">
  <meta property="og:type" content="website">
  <meta property="og:title" content="Bruno Machado — Portfólio de Projetos">
  <meta property="og:description" content="Automação e dados para a operação do setor elétrico, pesquisa em processamento de sinais e projetos de engenharia de controle.">
  <title>Bruno Machado — Automação, Dados & Engenharia</title>
  <style>
    :root {
      --bg: #0a111d; --bg-2: #0e1726; --surface: #111e2d; --surface-2: #162435;
      --line: rgba(176, 204, 233, .13); --line-strong: rgba(176, 204, 233, .23);
      --text: #eff5fd; --muted: #9aaec5; --dim: #6f869e; --accent: #66e3d3;
      --accent-deep: #173a3b; --blue: #7cb6ff; --orange: #f1b87e; --violet: #c7a4ff;
      --radius: 20px; --shadow: 0 24px 90px rgba(0,0,0,.26);
      --container: 1160px;
    }
    * {box-sizing:border-box}
    html {scroll-behavior:smooth; scroll-padding-top:100px}
    body {margin:0; background:var(--bg); color:var(--text); font: 16px/1.65 Inter, ui-sans-serif, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', sans-serif; -webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased}
    a {color:inherit; text-decoration:none}
    button {font:inherit}
    ::selection{background:rgba(102,227,211,.28);color:#fff}
    .skip {position:absolute;top:-60px;left:10px;z-index:200;padding:10px 18px;background:var(--accent);color:#0a111d;border-radius:8px}
    .skip:focus{top:10px}
    :focus-visible {outline:2px solid var(--accent); outline-offset:4px}
    .container {width:min(calc(100% - 48px),var(--container));margin-inline:auto}
    .ambient {position:absolute;z-index:0;top:-340px;right:-170px;width:900px;height:900px;pointer-events:none;background:radial-gradient(circle,rgba(45,142,149,.15) 0,rgba(55,86,159,.09) 35%,transparent 66%)}
    .site-header{position:sticky;z-index:100;top:0;background:rgba(10,17,29,.83);border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);backdrop-filter:blur(18px);-webkit-backdrop-filter:blur(18px)}
    .nav-wrap{min-height:76px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:28px}
    .brand{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:13px;white-space:nowrap}
    .brand-mark{display:grid;place-items:center;width:42px;height:42px;border:1px solid rgba(102,227,211,.38);border-radius:13px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#193c43,#122534);color:var(--accent);font-weight:800;letter-spacing:-.06em}
    .brand strong{display:block;font-size:14px;letter-spacing:.01em;line-height:1.2}
    .brand small{display:block;font-size:11px;color:var(--muted);line-height:1.4;margin-top:2px;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase}
    nav{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:30px}
    nav a{font-size:13px;color:#bdcbe0;font-weight:600;transition:color .2s}
    nav a:hover{color:var(--accent)}
    .nav-cta{padding:10px 16px;border:1px solid var(--line-strong);border-radius:10px;color:var(--text);font-size:13px;font-weight:700;white-space:nowrap;transition:background .2s}
    .nav-cta:hover{background:var(--surface-2)}
    .hero{position:relative;overflow:hidden;padding:108px 0 103px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}
    .hero-inner{position:relative;z-index:1;display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1.18fr) minmax(350px,.82fr);gap:70px;align-items:center}
    .eyebrow{display:inline-flex;gap:10px;align-items:center;color:var(--accent);font-weight:800;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.14em;font-size:11px}
    .eyebrow:before{content:'';width:25px;height:1px;background:var(--accent)}
    .hero h1{font-size:clamp(41px,5vw,64px);line-height:1.09;letter-spacing:-.055em;margin:22px 0 24px;font-weight:800;max-width:730px}
    .gradient-text{background:linear-gradient(100deg,#a4f2df 0,#84c2ff 72%,#a9c8fd 100%);background-clip:text;-webkit-background-clip:text;color:transparent}
    .lead{color:var(--muted);font-size:17px;max-width:630px;line-height:1.85;margin:0}
    .lead strong{color:var(--text);font-weight:700}
    .hero-actions{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:12px;margin-top:31px}
    .btn{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:9px;min-height:47px;padding:0 20px;border-radius:11px;font-weight:800;font-size:13px;border:1px solid transparent;transition:transform .2s, background .2s,border-color .2s;cursor:pointer}
    .btn:hover{transform:translateY(-2px)}
    .btn-primary{background:var(--accent);color:#09211f}
    .btn-primary:hover{background:#9af4e7}
    .btn-secondary{background:rgba(255,255,255,.025);border-color:var(--line-strong);color:#e8f3ff}
    .btn-secondary:hover{border-color:rgba(102,227,211,.6);background:rgba(102,227,211,.08)}
    .workflow-card{position:relative;background:linear-gradient(150deg,rgba(25,40,59,.93),rgba(12,24,37,.96));border:1px solid rgba(164,216,237,.2);border-radius:26px;padding:28px;box-shadow:var(--shadow);overflow:hidden}
    .workflow-card:after{content:'';position:absolute;right:-70px;bottom:-170px;width:290px;height:290px;border-radius:50%;background:radial-gradient(circle,rgba(102,227,211,.1),transparent 65%);pointer-events:none}
    .window-top{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:7px;color:var(--muted);font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.08em;margin-bottom:24px}
    .dot{width:7px;height:7px;border-radius:50%;background:#618198;opacity:.7}
    .window-top span:last-child{margin-left:auto}
    .workflow-heading{font-size:18px;line-height:1.4;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:-.025em;margin-bottom:6px}
    .workflow-sub{color:var(--muted);font-size:12px;margin-bottom:20px}
    .metric{border:1px solid var(--line);padding:18px;border-radius:14px;background:rgba(11,25,39,.8)}
    .metric + .metric{margin-top:12px}
    .metric-value{display:flex;align-items:baseline;gap:10px;font-size:34px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:-.04em;line-height:1.1;color:var(--accent)}
    .metric-value .from{font-size:20px;color:var(--dim);text-decoration:line-through;text-decoration-thickness:2px}
    .metric-value .arrow{font-size:20px;color:var(--muted)}
    .metric-label{display:block;color:var(--muted);font-size:12px;margin-top:6px}
    .flow-result{margin-top:20px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:12px;padding-top:18px;border-top:1px solid var(--line);color:var(--muted);font-size:11px}
    .flow-result strong{color:var(--accent);font-size:12px;display:flex;gap:7px;align-items:center}
    .quick-strip{border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);background:rgba(17,30,45,.45)}
    .quick-inner{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);padding:24px 0;gap:28px}
    .quick-item{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:15px}
    .quick-item:not(:last-child){border-right:1px solid var(--line)}
    .quick-ico{display:grid;place-items:center;width:38px;height:38px;border-radius:11px;background:rgba(102,227,211,.075);color:var(--accent);font-size:18px;flex:none}
    .quick-item b{font-size:13px;display:block;line-height:1.3}
    .quick-item span{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted);display:block;margin-top:3px}
    section{padding:105px 0}
    .section-top{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:end;gap:28px;margin-bottom:37px}
    .section-kicker{font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.16em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--accent);font-weight:800;margin:0 0 13px}
    h2{font-size:clamp(31px,3.25vw,45px);letter-spacing:-.046em;line-height:1.16;margin:0;font-weight:800}
    .section-desc{color:var(--muted);max-width:420px;font-size:14px;margin:0}
    .filters{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-bottom:28px}
    .filter{border:1px solid var(--line);background:transparent;color:#9dafc3;padding:9px 16px;border-radius:99px;font-size:12px;font-weight:800;cursor:pointer;transition:background .2s,color .2s,border-color .2s}
    .filter:hover{border-color:var(--line-strong);color:var(--text)}
    .filter[aria-pressed="true"]{border-color:rgba(102,227,211,.45);background:rgba(102,227,211,.12);color:var(--accent)}
    .grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr));gap:19px}
    .project{display:flex;flex-direction:column;min-height:380px;background:linear-gradient(160deg,#121f30,#101c2b 70%);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:var(--radius);padding:25px;position:relative;overflow:hidden;transition:border-color .2s,transform .2s,box-shadow .2s}
    .project:hover{border-color:rgba(102,227,211,.38);transform:translateY(-4px);box-shadow:0 19px 50px rgba(0,0,0,.2)}
    .project[hidden]{display:none!important}
    .project:before{content:'';position:absolute;top:0;left:0;right:0;height:2px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,var(--card-accent,var(--accent)),transparent);opacity:.7}
    .project-top{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;margin-bottom:31px;gap:12px}
    .project-icon{display:grid;place-items:center;width:48px;height:48px;border-radius:14px;background:var(--card-bg,rgba(102,227,211,.08));color:var(--card-accent,var(--accent));border:1px solid var(--line)}
    .project-icon svg{width:23px;height:23px}
    .category{font-size:10px;color:#8fa9c1;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.09em;font-weight:800;white-space:nowrap}
    .project h3{font-size:21px;line-height:1.34;letter-spacing:-.03em;margin:0 0 12px}
    .project p{color:var(--muted);font-size:13px;line-height:1.75;margin:0 0 21px}
    .project .result{color:var(--accent);font-size:12px;font-weight:800;margin:-8px 0 18px}
    .tags{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:6px;margin-top:auto}
    .tag{font-size:10px;font-weight:700;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:6px;padding:5px 8px;color:#b6c6d9;background:rgba(255,255,255,.02)}
    .project-button{display:flex;gap:9px;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;width:100%;padding:18px 0 0;margin-top:19px;border:0;border-top:1px solid var(--line);background:transparent;color:var(--accent);font-size:12px;font-weight:800;text-align:left;cursor:pointer}
    .project-button span:last-child{font-size:17px;transition:transform .2s}
    .project-button:hover span:last-child{transform:translateX(4px)}
    .privacy-note{display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:center;margin-top:26px;color:var(--dim);font-size:12px}
    .privacy-note svg{color:var(--accent);flex:none}
    .about-section{background:var(--bg-2);border-top:1px solid var(--line);border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}
    .about-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:95px}
    .about-grid p{color:var(--muted);font-size:15px;line-height:1.9}
    .about-grid .quote{margin:23px 0 0;padding-left:19px;border-left:2px solid var(--accent);font-size:17px;color:#e2edf8;font-weight:650;line-height:1.65}
    .xp{border:1px solid rgba(102,227,211,.25);background:rgba(102,227,211,.05);border-radius:14px;padding:18px 20px;margin:26px 0 0}
    .xp b{display:block;font-size:15px}
    .xp span{display:block;color:var(--muted);font-size:13px;margin-top:3px}
    .stack-list{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:11px}
    .stack-row{border:1px solid var(--line);background:rgba(255,255,255,.015);padding:16px 18px;border-radius:12px}
    .stack-row b{display:block;font-size:12px;color:var(--accent);margin-bottom:5px}
    .stack-row span{font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)}
    .contact-section{text-align:center;padding:110px 0 103px}
    .contact-section h2{max-width:740px;margin-inline:auto}
    .contact-section p{color:var(--muted);font-size:15px;max-width:570px;margin:20px auto 29px}
    .contact-note{font-size:11px!important;margin-top:14px!important}
    footer{border-top:1px solid var(--line);padding:24px 0 32px}
    .footer-inner{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:22px;align-items:center;color:var(--dim);font-size:11px}
    .footer-inner a{color:#b1ceda}
    dialog{background:#111d2c;border:1px solid rgba(157,193,213,.27);color:var(--text);border-radius:22px;max-width:740px;width:min(calc(100% - 32px),740px);max-height:min(86vh,850px);padding:0;box-shadow:0 30px 110px rgba(0,0,0,.7)}
    dialog::backdrop{background:rgba(3,9,16,.79);backdrop-filter:blur(7px)}
    .dialog-content{padding:34px 36px 35px;overflow-y:auto;max-height:86vh}
    .dialog-head{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:20px;align-items:start}
    .dialog-close{display:grid;place-items:center;border:1px solid var(--line-strong);background:transparent;color:var(--text);width:34px;height:34px;border-radius:10px;cursor:pointer;flex:none;font-size:23px;line-height:1}
    .dialog-close:hover{background:var(--surface-2)}
    .dialog-title{font-size:30px;line-height:1.2;letter-spacing:-.045em;margin:8px 0 17px}
    .dialog-summary{font-size:14px;color:#b3c7d9;line-height:1.8;margin:0 0 22px}
    .detail-block{margin-top:22px;padding-top:18px;border-top:1px solid var(--line)}
    .detail-block h4{font-size:12px;color:var(--accent);text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.1em;margin:0 0 7px}
    .detail-block p{font-size:13px;color:var(--muted);margin:0;line-height:1.75}
    .detail-tech{display:flex;gap:7px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:23px}
    @media (max-width:1050px){
      .hero-inner{gap:34px;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr) minmax(310px,.8fr)}
      .hero{padding:80px 0}.grid{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr))}.about-grid{gap:42px}
    }
    @media (max-width:760px){
      .container{width:min(calc(100% - 32px),var(--container))}
      .nav-wrap{min-height:68px}.brand-mark{width:37px;height:37px}.brand strong{font-size:12px}.brand small{font-size:9px}
      nav{gap:14px}nav a{display:none}.nav-cta{font-size:11px;padding:9px 11px}
      .hero{padding:65px 0 69px}.hero-inner{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:40px}.hero h1{font-size:clamp(34px,9vw,56px)}.lead{font-size:15px}
      .workflow-card{max-width:510px;width:100%;margin:auto}.quick-inner{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:14px;padding:25px 0}.quick-item:not(:last-child){border-right:0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);padding-bottom:14px}
      section{padding:74px 0}.section-top{display:block}.section-desc{margin-top:14px}.grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}.project{min-height:unset}.project-top{margin-bottom:24px}
      .about-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:28px}.contact-section{padding:77px 0}.footer-inner{display:block}.footer-inner span{display:block;margin:4px 0}
      .dialog-content{padding:24px}.dialog-title{font-size:25px}
    }
    @media (prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){html{scroll-behavior:auto}*,*:before,*:after{transition:none!important;animation:none!important}}
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <a href="#conteudo" class="skip">Ir para o conteúdo</a>
  <header class="site-header">
    <div class="container nav-wrap">
      <a class="brand" href="#inicio" aria-label="Bruno Machado, voltar ao início">
        <span class="brand-mark">BM</span>
        <span><strong>Bruno Machado</strong><small>Engenharia & tecnologia</small></span>
      </a>
      <nav aria-label="Navegação principal">
        <a href="#projetos">Projetos</a>
        <a href="#sobre">Sobre</a>
        <a href="#contato">Contato</a>
        <a class="nav-cta" href="mailto:brunomachadofurnopires@gmail.com?subject=Contato%20pelo%20portf%C3%B3lio">Vamos conversar ↗</a>
      </nav>
    </div>
  </header>
  <main id="conteudo">
    <section class="hero" id="inicio" aria-labelledby="hero-heading">
      <div class="ambient"></div>
      <div class="container hero-inner">
        <div>
          <span class="eyebrow">Automação • Dados • Engenharia</span>
          <h1 id="hero-heading">Automação e dados para a <span class="gradient-text">operação do setor elétrico.</span></h1>
          <p class="lead">Sou Bruno Machado, estudante de Engenharia Elétrica no IFES e <strong>estagiário de Operação e Manutenção na AXIA Energia (Eletrobras)</strong>. Desenvolvo aplicativos, integrações e automações que tiram trabalho manual da rotina de inspeção e manutenção de subestações.</p>
          <div class="hero-actions">
            <a class="btn btn-primary" href="#projetos">Conheça meus projetos <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
            <a class="btn btn-secondary" href="#sobre">Minha trajetória <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="workflow-card">
          <div class="window-top"><span class="dot"></span><span class="dot"></span><span class="dot"></span><span>RESULTADOS NO ESTÁGIO</span></div>
          <div class="workflow-heading">Digitalização de inspeções de subestações</div>
          <div class="workflow-sub">AXIA Energia (Eletrobras) · Operação e Manutenção</div>
          <div class="metric">
            <div class="metric-value">15+</div>
            <span class="metric-label">inspeções levadas do papel para aplicativos digitais</span>
          </div>
          <div class="metric">
            <div class="metric-value"><span class="from">~2 h</span><span class="arrow" aria-hidden="true">→</span>~10 min</div>
            <span class="metric-label">para gerar um relatório de inspeção, com a automação</span>
          </div>
          <div class="flow-result"><span>Power Apps · Power Automate · SharePoint</span><strong><span aria-hidden="true">●</span> Em uso</strong></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
    <div class="quick-strip" aria-label="Áreas de atuação">
      <div class="container quick-inner">
        <div class="quick-item"><div class="quick-ico" aria-hidden="true">↗</div><div><b>Automação de ponta a ponta</b><span>Aplicativos, fluxos e integração de sistemas</span></div></div>
        <div class="quick-item"><div class="quick-ico" aria-hidden="true">◈</div><div><b>Dados que orientam decisões</b><span>Tratamento, análise e indicadores</span></div></div>
        <div class="quick-item"><div class="quick-ico" aria-hidden="true">⌁</div><div><b>Base sólida em engenharia</b><span>Controle, sinais e experimentação</span></div></div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <section id="projetos" aria-labelledby="project-heading">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="section-top">
          <div><p class="section-kicker">Trabalhos selecionados</p><h2 id="project-heading">Projetos e entregas<span style="color:var(--accent)">.</span></h2></div>
          <p class="section-desc">Projetos do estágio, ferramentas em Python, pesquisa acadêmica e engenharia de controle. Clique em um projeto para ver o desafio, o que eu fiz e o resultado.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="filters" role="group" aria-label="Filtrar projetos por área">
          <button class="filter" data-filter="todos" aria-pressed="true" type="button">Todos <span id="all-count"></span></button>
          <button class="filter" data-filter="automacao" aria-pressed="false" type="button">Automação & IA</button>
          <button class="filter" data-filter="dados" aria-pressed="false" type="button">Dados & pesquisa</button>
          <button class="filter" data-filter="engenharia" aria-pressed="false" type="button">Engenharia</button>
        </div>
        <div class="grid" id="projects-grid">
          <article class="project" data-category="automacao" style="--card-accent:#c7a4ff;--card-bg:rgba(199,164,255,.08)">
            <div class="project-top"><div class="project-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8"><rect x="4" y="7" width="16" height="12" rx="3"/><path d="M12 7V3m-3 9h.01M15 12h.01M9 16h6"/></svg></div><span class="category">IA generativa</span></div>
            <h3>Agente de IA para alinhamento de segurança</h3>
            <p>Criei um agente no Microsoft Copilot que lê os documentos de segurança da atividade (APR e PEX) e gera a apresentação para a equipe e o termo de ciência para assinatura.</p>
            <div class="tags"><span class="tag">Microsoft Copilot</span><span class="tag">IA generativa</span><span class="tag">Documentos</span></div>
            <button type="button" class="project-button" data-project="agente"><span>Ver estudo de caso</span><span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></button>
          </article>
          <article class="project" data-category="automacao" style="--card-accent:#66e3d3;--card-bg:rgba(102,227,211,.08)">
            <div class="project-top"><div class="project-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8"><rect x="4" y="3" width="16" height="18" rx="2"/><path d="M8 8h8M8 12h8m-8 4h5"/></svg></div><span class="category">Automação corporativa</span></div>
            <h3>Digitalização de inspeções de subestações</h3>
            <p>Desenvolvi aplicativos que registram cada item da inspeção, fotos de evidência e não conformidades, e geram o relatório em PDF automaticamente.</p>
            <p class="result">15+ inspeções digitalizadas · relatório de ~2 h para ~10 min</p>
            <div class="tags"><span class="tag">Power Apps</span><span class="tag">Power Automate</span><span class="tag">SharePoint</span></div>
            <button type="button" class="project-button" data-project="inspecoes"><span>Ver estudo de caso</span><span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></button>
